# Runtime state written by a branch at work - never source, never reviewable.
# .backup/ is the memory rollover's own safety copy, .chroma/ the vector store's
# sqlite. Both are regenerated from the live system; a committed one is a stale
# lie about what the branch remembers.
# NOT listed here on purpose: dropbox/. It looks like the same kind of dirt, but
# the only file in it is the wheel mockup Patrick voted on - an artefact, not
# state. It stays visible in status until someone rules on where it belongs.
.backup/
.chroma/
